nish campaign + DLC, and some nice challenge runs. After those 50hrs the game definitely falls of hard unless you just love the genre, but can still 100% be fun if you have new friends to indoctrinate.\n\nGrab 1-3 friends get your comms on, and get ready for a nice blast of fun.\n\nDO NOT BUY AT FULL PRICE. I bought 4 copies for the whole crew of ultimate edition for 95% off. The insane sale will come, check 3rd party steam key websites too.\n\nimmaculate fps", "timestamp_created": 1784090955, "timestamp_updated": 1784090955, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.618335187435150146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 31, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "230491729", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018300922", "personaname": "FairLight", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018300922/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 87, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 87, "last_played": 1783672726, "avatar": "bb2de0fbd4f178c78a42e340a9c0f2466c41e150"}, "language": "english", "review": "BACK4BLOOD 2021, I PLAYED IT DUDE... AND IT SUCKED.\n\nGeneric and uninspired. I've played roblox games with better gameplay. You can tell this was released in the 2020's, which isnt a complement", "timestamp_created": 1784069957, "timestamp_updated": 1784069957, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481927722692489624", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230477296", "author": {"steamid": "765611980267